# ALLOWLIST. This folder will hold things that must never be published: the ROM, the asset
# metadata fetched at build time (src/assets/, tools/fetch_assets.sh) and the ID headers made from
# it (src/generated/, tools/gen_headers.sh), the fetch's clone (refs/), qemu run dirs, build output.
# Only source, scripts and docs are tracked: everything is ignored by the leading "*" and has to be
# re-included below.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.c
!*.h
!*.s
!*.inc
!*.cc
!*.in
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.py
!Makefile
!LICENSE
!include/make/PRdefs
!tools/extract
!tools/extract-segment
!tools/mkrawobject
!tools/mksimpleelf
!tools/mktextures
!tools/patchmips3
!tools/rarezip
!tools/rareunzip
!tools/assetmgr/mk*
!miyoo/game.json
!miyoo/icon.png
!miyoo/templates/app_config.json
# Never, even if the patterns above match:
/src/assets/
/src/generated/
/refs/
/build/
/extracted/
__pycache__/
